      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not define the term ‘remission’ itself; it only describes a ‘remission consultation’ for patients entering a monitoring phase after treatment, so the definition overgeneralizes from a program title to a term definition.",
        "‘Remission consultation,’ ‘post-treatment phase,’ and ‘personalized follow-up’ are context details from the study, not evidence that remission is defined as that care pathway in the packet.",
        "The definition adds a broader claim that the packet ‘does not provide a broader general definition,’ which is not supported by the packet and is not a definitional statement about the term."
